---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<PageLayout
  meta={{
    title: 'Home',
    description: 'Documenting my journey of learning AI and AI agents from zero.'
  }}
  highlightColor='#659EB9'
>
  <main class='mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col gap-16 py-16 sm:py-24'>
    <section class='flex flex-col gap-6'>
      <p class='text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground'>
        My Learning Blog
      </p>

      <h1 class='max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl'>
        Learning from zero, one project at a time.
      </h1>

      <p class='max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground'>
        I’m James. This blog documents my journey of learning programming, artificial intelligence,
        and AI agents from zero, with a focus on understanding how models work, building things
        myself, and recording the problems I encounter and how I solve them.
      </p>

      <div class='flex flex-wrap gap-3'>
        <a
          class='rounded-lg bg-foreground px-4 py-2 text-background no-underline transition-opacity hover:opacity-80'
          href='/en/blog'
        >
          Read the blog
        </a>
        <a
          class='rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-2 text-foreground no-underline hover:bg-muted'
          href='/en/notes'
        >
          Browse notes
        </a>
        <a
          class='rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-2 text-foreground no-underline hover:bg-muted'
          href='/en/about'
        >
          About me
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class='mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold'>Currently learning</h2>

      <div class='grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3'>
        <article class='rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5'>
          <p class='mb-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground'>Large language models</p>
          <h3 class='font-semibold'>Building LLMs from scratch</h3>
          <p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            Implementing model components to understand tokenization, attention, training, and text
            generation.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class='rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5'>
          <p class='mb-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground'>Reasoning models</p>
          <h3 class='font-semibold'>Understanding model reasoning</h3>
          <p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            Studying the foundations of reasoning models and how training and inference shape model
            behavior.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class='rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5'>
          <p class='mb-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground'>Reinforcement learning</p>
          <h3 class='font-semibold'>RL mathematical foundations</h3>
          <p class='mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            Learning how to code common algorithms in RL and understand the maths behind them.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-6 sm:p-8'>
      <p class='text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground'>Learning approach</p>
      <h2 class='mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold'>From principles to implementation</h2>
      <p class='mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-muted-foreground'>
        I work on several learning projects in parallel, but this page shows only the main themes.
        Specific experiments, problems, and milestones will gradually be organized into the Blog and
        Notes sections.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PageLayout>
